==== SCRIPT ====
jq -n -c '[[1,[2]]|walk(if type == "number" then . + 1 else . end)], [{"a":"b","c":[{"a":1}]} | walk(if type == "object" then del(.a) else . end)], [[[3,1],[2]] | walk(if type == "array" then sort else . end)]'
